Problem
Create Azure VM named nautilus-vm with static public IP nautilus-pip.

Solution
Portal Steps:

Generate SSH key on azure-client:

bash
ssh-keygen -t rsa -b 2048 -f ~/.ssh/azure_vm_key -N ""
cat ~/.ssh/azure_vm_key.pub
Create Static Public IP nautilus-pip (SKU: Standard, Assignment: Static)

Create VM nautilus-vm:

Image: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS

Size: Standard_B1s

Authentication: SSH public key

Attach static IP nautilus-pip

Test SSH:

bash
ssh -i ~/.ssh/azure_vm_key azureuser@<NAUTILUS_PIP_PUBLIC_IP>
